{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-86793","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120271","text":"Weave — a static cost certificate for the [&] stack's resource rung"}]},{"id":"blk-86794","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120272","text":"A research prototype, built invariant-first: find the invariants, state the rules, enforce them in code, close the loop. Plain Node (v18+), no dependencies. Run any script with "},{"id":"spn-120273","marks":["code"],"text":"node <path>"},{"id":"spn-120274","text":" (e.g. "},{"id":"spn-120275","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120276","text":"), or use the npm scripts: "},{"id":"spn-120277","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run demo"},{"id":"spn-120278","text":", "},{"id":"spn-120279","marks":["code"],"text":"npm test"},{"id":"spn-120280","text":", "},{"id":"spn-120281","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run proofs"},{"id":"spn-120282","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-86795","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120283","marks":["bold"],"text":"Positioning (read `weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md` first)."},{"id":"spn-120284","text":" Weave began as \"a better Bend/HVM,\" but with box-and-box and OpenSentience in frame that framing is wrong. Weave is "},{"id":"spn-120285","marks":["italic"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-120286","text":" a Bend/HVM competitor — it is a deep probe of one rung of the [&] stack: the "},{"id":"spn-120287","marks":["bold"],"text":"resource rung"},{"id":"spn-120288","text":" (the affine ledger, \"can we afford it\"), and specifically the piece box-and-box doesn't yet have — a "},{"id":"spn-120289","marks":["bold"],"text":"static cost certificate"},{"id":"spn-120290","text":" computed before a computation runs, not a runtime meter read after. HVM4 (now on GitHub in early preview) is the intended execution backend; the cost certificate is substrate-independent, so lowering to HVM4 is an execution choice, not a correctness dependency."}]},{"id":"blk-86796","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120291","text":"New here? Check the proof, don't take my word for it"}]},{"id":"blk-86797","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120292","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/"}],"text":"`proofs/`"},{"id":"spn-120293","text":" holds "},{"id":"spn-120294","marks":["bold"],"text":"proof you can verify without running anything"},{"id":"spn-120295","text":" from committed text — no install, no run. Read "},{"id":"spn-120296","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/README.md"}],"text":"`proofs/README.md`"},{"id":"spn-120297","text":", then eyeball "},{"id":"spn-120298","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/RECEIPTS.txt"}],"text":"`proofs/RECEIPTS.txt`"},{"id":"spn-120299","text":" (the static cost grade vs. measured growth, checkable by finite differences; the falsifiable soundness predicate; a cross-check against the independent HVM4 runtime) and "},{"id":"spn-120300","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/transcripts/"}],"text":"`proofs/transcripts/`"},{"id":"spn-120301","text":" (the exact stdout of every script, claim-by-claim). Regenerate with "},{"id":"spn-120302","marks":["code"],"text":"node proofs/generate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120303","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-120304","marks":["code"],"text":"node tools/regenerate-proofs.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120305","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-86798","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120306","text":"Layout"}]},{"id":"blk-86799","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"weave/\n  README.md                            this file\n  proofs/     RECEIPTS.txt (by-hand-checkable) + transcripts/ (per-script) + generate.mjs + README.md\n  src/        the engine (pure library, exports an API; each runs a demo when invoked directly)\n  test/       the validation suites (differential / property / soundness / cross-engine)\n  surface/    weave_surface.exs        the Elixir macro front-end\n  tools/      regenerate-proofs.mjs    rebuilds proofs/transcripts/ (--check verifies no drift)\n  docs/        positioning + design docs"},{"id":"blk-86800","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120307","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-120308","text":" — read these first"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86802","spans":[{"id":"spn-120309","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-86803","spans":[{"id":"spn-120310","text":"What it is"}]}],"id":"blk-86801","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86804","spans":[{"id":"spn-120311","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md"}]},{"id":"blk-86805","spans":[{"id":"spn-120312","marks":["bold"],"text":"Start here."},{"id":"spn-120313","text":" Repositions Weave inside the [&] stack, grades the stack against the AIOS agent-OS reference (gap analysis), and specifies the cost-certificate → resource-rung integration and the HVM4 backend plan."}]}],[{"id":"blk-86806","spans":[{"id":"spn-120314","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/weave-design.md"}]},{"id":"blk-86807","spans":[{"id":"spn-120315","text":"The design doc: thesis, openings in Bend, the five invariants, the closed loop. "},{"id":"spn-120316","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read after the positioning doc — it predates the [&]-stack reframe and the validation work, so treat it as the starting hypothesis."}]}]]},{"id":"blk-86808","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120317","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-120318","text":" — the engine"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86810","spans":[{"id":"spn-120319","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-86811","spans":[{"id":"spn-120320","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-86812","spans":[{"id":"spn-120321","text":"Run"}]}],"id":"blk-86809","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86813","spans":[{"id":"spn-120322","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86814","spans":[{"id":"spn-120323","text":"The core. An Interaction-Calculus reducer (β + sup/dup, metered, with time and space vetoes), the static invariant checker (affine / label-coherence / κ), and a small superposed-search + evolution loop."}]},{"id":"blk-86815","spans":[{"id":"spn-120324","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86816","spans":[{"id":"spn-120325","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-classify.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86817","spans":[{"id":"spn-120326","text":"Cost as a type, statically. Infers types, reports the iteration "},{"id":"spn-120327","marks":["italic"],"text":"rank"},{"id":"spn-120328","text":" (poly / exp / tower) with no execution, and cross-checks against measured cost."}]},{"id":"blk-86818","spans":[{"id":"spn-120329","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-classify.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86819","spans":[{"id":"spn-120330","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86820","spans":[{"id":"spn-120331","marks":["bold"],"text":"The certificate."},{"id":"spn-120332","text":" Type-directed EAL box-decoration: the static box-nesting "},{"id":"spn-120333","marks":["italic"],"text":"depth"},{"id":"spn-120334","text":" (= certified elementary tower height) with a per-binder certificate. Upgrades the rank proxy toward a real bound."}]},{"id":"blk-86821","spans":[{"id":"spn-120335","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-eal.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86822","spans":[{"id":"spn-120336","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal-degree.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86823","spans":[{"id":"spn-120337","text":"Stage B: recovers the polynomial "},{"id":"spn-120338","marks":["italic"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-120339","text":" inside the depth-1 rung by finite differences — the measured ground truth that static LAL (Baillot–Terui) would prove."}]},{"id":"blk-86824","spans":[{"id":"spn-120340","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-eal-degree.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86825","spans":[{"id":"spn-120341","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-cost.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86826","spans":[{"id":"spn-120342","text":"The cost cliff, measured: addition (linear), multiplication (polynomial), exponentiation towers (detonate). Shows source size ≠ cost."}]},{"id":"blk-86827","spans":[{"id":"spn-120343","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-cost.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86828","spans":[{"id":"spn-120344","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-hvm4.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86829","spans":[{"id":"spn-120345","text":"Local round-trip lowering to a generic HVM-core syntax + inverse parser (semantics-preserving validation, no external binary)."}]},{"id":"blk-86830","spans":[{"id":"spn-120346","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-hvm4.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86831","spans":[{"id":"spn-120347","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-backend.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86832","spans":[{"id":"spn-120348","text":"The \"backend\" the surface lowers to (the Nx/EXLA role): reads an IR term as JSON and runs the real engine."}]},{"id":"blk-86833","spans":[{"id":"spn-120349","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-backend.mjs <op> '<ir-json>'"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-86834","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120350","marks":["code"],"text":"test/"},{"id":"spn-120351","text":" — the validation suites"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86836","spans":[{"id":"spn-120352","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-86837","spans":[{"id":"spn-120353","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-86838","spans":[{"id":"spn-120354","text":"Run"}]}],"id":"blk-86835","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86839","spans":[{"id":"spn-120355","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-validate.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86840","spans":[{"id":"spn-120356","text":"Differential testing: linearize a pure λ-term, reduce with Weave, compare the normal form to a reference normal-order evaluator. "},{"id":"spn-120357","marks":["bold"],"text":"12/12."}]},{"id":"blk-86841","spans":[{"id":"spn-120358","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-validate.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86842","spans":[{"id":"spn-120359","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-proptest.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86843","spans":[{"id":"spn-120360","text":"Checker-gated property testing over thousands of random simply-typed terms. None mis-evaluated."}]},{"id":"blk-86844","spans":[{"id":"spn-120361","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-proptest.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86845","spans":[{"id":"spn-120362","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-soundness.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86846","spans":[{"id":"spn-120363","text":"Stress-tests the classifier verdict against measured cost over an adversarial battery + ~2000 random terms. Falsifiable predicate: no rank≤1 term detonated."}]},{"id":"blk-86847","spans":[{"id":"spn-120364","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-soundness.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86848","spans":[{"id":"spn-120365","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-fold-test.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86849","spans":[{"id":"spn-120366","text":"Differential test for the structural-recursion layer: linearized "},{"id":"spn-120367","marks":["code"],"text":"fold"},{"id":"spn-120368","text":" vs JS ground truth over random lists × {add, mul, sub}. "},{"id":"spn-120369","marks":["bold"],"text":"1200/1200."}]},{"id":"blk-86850","spans":[{"id":"spn-120370","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-fold-test.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86851","spans":[{"id":"spn-120371","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-eal-test.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86852","spans":[{"id":"spn-120372","text":"Validates the EAL "},{"id":"spn-120373","marks":["bold"],"text":"certificate"},{"id":"spn-120374","text":" against "},{"id":"spn-120375","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-120376","text":" cost (not the proxy): certified-cheap never detonates, "},{"id":"spn-120377","marks":["code"],"text":"eal:true"},{"id":"spn-120378","text":" reduces oracle-free (no residue), depth matches the validated rank."}]},{"id":"blk-86853","spans":[{"id":"spn-120379","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-eal-test.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86854","spans":[{"id":"spn-120380","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-hvm4-run.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86855","spans":[{"id":"spn-120381","text":"The real HVM4 backend: lowers to HVM4 surface syntax, shells to the built binary, and differential-tests integer outputs against the toy reducer. "},{"id":"spn-120382","marks":["bold"],"text":"6/6."},{"id":"spn-120383","text":" Needs "},{"id":"spn-120384","marks":["code"],"text":"~/hvm4/src/hvm"},{"id":"spn-120385","text":" (or "},{"id":"spn-120386","marks":["code"],"text":"HVM4_BIN="},{"id":"spn-120387","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-86856","spans":[{"id":"spn-120388","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-hvm4-run.mjs"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-86857","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120389","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/"},{"id":"spn-120390","text":" — the Elixir front-end"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86859","spans":[{"id":"spn-120391","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-86860","spans":[{"id":"spn-120392","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-86861","spans":[{"id":"spn-120393","text":"Run"}]}],"id":"blk-86858","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86862","spans":[{"id":"spn-120394","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/weave_surface.exs"}]},{"id":"blk-86863","spans":[{"id":"spn-120395","text":"An Elixir macro surface. "},{"id":"spn-120396","marks":["code"],"text":"defweave"},{"id":"spn-120397","text":" compiles native "},{"id":"spn-120398","marks":["code"],"text":"fn"},{"id":"spn-120399","text":" syntax — integer literals, "},{"id":"spn-120400","marks":["code"],"text":"+"},{"id":"spn-120401","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120402","marks":["code"],"text":"*"},{"id":"spn-120403","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120404","marks":["code"],"text":"-"},{"id":"spn-120405","text":", list literals, "},{"id":"spn-120406","marks":["code"],"text":"fold"},{"id":"spn-120407","text":" — into Weave IR at compile time, then shells to "},{"id":"spn-120408","marks":["code"],"text":"../src/weave-backend.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120409","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-86864","spans":[{"id":"spn-120410","marks":["code"],"text":"elixir surface/weave_surface.exs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86865","spans":[{"id":"spn-120411","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/weave_govern.exs"}]},{"id":"blk-86866","spans":[{"id":"spn-120412","marks":["bold"],"text":"The stack, end to end."},{"id":"spn-120413","text":" Authors four plans with "},{"id":"spn-120414","marks":["code"],"text":"defweave"},{"id":"spn-120415","text":", certifies each one's cost class with "},{"id":"spn-120416","marks":["code"],"text":"Weave.classify"},{"id":"spn-120417","text":" (static — no execution), shells to the box-and-box governance kernel (the highest-utility exponential is "},{"id":"spn-120418","marks":["bold"],"text":"annihilated"},{"id":"spn-120419","text":" "},{"id":"spn-120420","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-120421","text":" by the resource-rung floor), "},{"id":"spn-120422","marks":["bold"],"text":"runs"},{"id":"spn-120423","text":" the polynomial winner to a real answer ("},{"id":"spn-120424","marks":["code"],"text":"210"},{"id":"spn-120425","text":"), then runs the refused tower anyway and watches it "},{"id":"spn-120426","marks":["bold"],"text":"detonate"},{"id":"spn-120427","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-120428","marks":["code"],"text":"over-space"},{"id":"spn-120429","text":") — vindicating the static refusal. Cost is a type, and the type decides."}]},{"id":"blk-86867","spans":[{"id":"spn-120430","marks":["code"],"text":"elixir surface/weave_govern.exs"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-86868","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120431","text":"Honest status"}]},{"id":"blk-86869","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120432","text":"What runs and is validated:"}]},{"id":"blk-86870","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86872","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120433","text":"The reducer is sound on every term tested — the 12-term battery plus ~3000 random simply-typed"}]}],"id":"blk-86871","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86873","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120434","text":"terms plus Church arithmetic. No counterexample found."}]},{"id":"blk-86874","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120435","text":"The cost cliff is real and measured; the static classifier predicts it from structure before"}]}],"id":"blk-86875","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86877","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120436","text":"running, and the prediction matches."}]},{"id":"blk-86878","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86880","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120437","marks":["bold"],"text":"Recursion fork: decided."},{"id":"spn-120438","text":" The surface offers "},{"id":"spn-120439","marks":["italic"],"text":"structural"},{"id":"spn-120440","text":" recursion (fold over a list),"}]}],"id":"blk-86879","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86881","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120441","text":"not a general "},{"id":"spn-120442","marks":["code"],"text":"fix"},{"id":"spn-120443","text":". A Church-encoded list is its own right fold, so recursion on the spine is total, has no fixpoint, and stays in the elementary/certified fragment — the feature is also the limit, by design."}]},{"id":"blk-86882","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86884","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120444","marks":["bold"],"text":"Primitives + a list ADT are in, and the surface is now writable."},{"id":"spn-120445","text":" Native integers and "},{"id":"spn-120446","marks":["code"],"text":"+"},{"id":"spn-120447","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120448","marks":["code"],"text":"*"},{"id":"spn-120449","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120450","marks":["code"],"text":"-"}]}],"id":"blk-86883","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86885","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120451","text":"lower to a strict "},{"id":"spn-120452","marks":["code"],"text":"Op"},{"id":"spn-120453","text":" node (type-order 0, no cost-rank contribution); list literals lower to Church lists; "},{"id":"spn-120454","marks":["code"],"text":"fold"},{"id":"spn-120455","text":" is the list applied. Duplicating an "},{"id":"spn-120456","marks":["code"],"text":"Op"},{"id":"spn-120457","text":"-carrying combiner needed one new rule — "},{"id":"spn-120458","marks":["code"],"text":"OP-SUP"},{"id":"spn-120459","text":", the operator/superposition commutation, exactly parallel to the existing "},{"id":"spn-120460","marks":["code"],"text":"APP-SUP"},{"id":"spn-120461","text":". With it, linearized folds match JS ground truth "},{"id":"spn-120462","marks":["bold"],"text":"1200/1200"},{"id":"spn-120463","text":" over random lists and operators, and "},{"id":"spn-120464","marks":["code"],"text":"sum"},{"id":"spn-120465","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120466","marks":["code"],"text":"product"},{"id":"spn-120467","text":" over a list literal run end-to-end through Elixir and classify rank-1 polynomial."}]},{"id":"blk-86886","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120468","text":"What is a corrected claim (the validation overturned earlier guesses):"}]},{"id":"blk-86887","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86889","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120469","text":"An early discussion called Church multiplication the \"oracle boundary.\" That was wrong — it was a"}]}],"id":"blk-86888","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86890","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120470","text":"missing "},{"id":"spn-120471","marks":["code"],"text":"DUP-APP"},{"id":"spn-120472","text":" commutation rule in the reducer, since fixed. There is no known boundary within the tested fragment."}]},{"id":"blk-86891","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86893","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120473","text":"The static invariants "},{"id":"spn-120474","marks":["code"],"text":"I1"},{"id":"spn-120475","text":" (affine) + "},{"id":"spn-120476","marks":["code"],"text":"I2"},{"id":"spn-120477","text":" (labels) are "},{"id":"spn-120478","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-120479","text":" sufficient for soundness — a term"}]}],"id":"blk-86892","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86894","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120480","text":"exists that they accept but a naive reducer mis-evaluates. They are a source-level discipline, not a soundness certificate."}]},{"id":"blk-86895","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120481","text":"What is a heuristic, not a theorem:"}]},{"id":"blk-86896","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86898","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120482","marks":["code"],"text":"weave-classify"},{"id":"spn-120483","text":" uses STLC type-order as a proxy for the complexity rung. It is principled"}]}],"id":"blk-86897","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86899","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120484","text":"(higher-order iteration climbs the Grzegorczyk hierarchy) and validated on these families, but it is an under-approximation of full Elementary/Light-Affine inference, reports the ladder "},{"id":"spn-120485","marks":["italic"],"text":"rung"},{"id":"spn-120486","text":" not the polynomial degree, and goes silent on terms that aren't simply-typable."}]},{"id":"blk-86900","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120487","text":"The thesis, as far as it's earned"}]},{"id":"blk-86901","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120488","text":"The defensible core is substructural: you get a guarantee by removing the structural rule that would let you violate it, so the violation becomes inexpressible. In this style the "},{"id":"spn-120489","marks":["italic"],"text":"safety invariant"},{"id":"spn-120490","text":" and the "},{"id":"spn-120491","marks":["italic"],"text":"cost guarantee"},{"id":"spn-120492","text":" are the same object — linearity-with-stratification simultaneously makes reduction sound, licenses the oracle-free fast path, and grades cost. Two of those faces now have running artifacts (soundness: "},{"id":"spn-120493","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-validate"},{"id":"spn-120494","text":"; cost: "},{"id":"spn-120495","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-classify"},{"id":"spn-120496","text":"), and all three are exhibited together — checkable by hand — in "},{"id":"spn-120497","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/RECEIPTS.txt"}],"text":"`proofs/RECEIPTS.txt`"},{"id":"spn-120498","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-86902","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120499","text":"Placed in the [&] stack, this is the "},{"id":"spn-120500","marks":["bold"],"text":"resource rung"},{"id":"spn-120501","text":" made into a static certificate. box-and-box's resource rung is a "},{"id":"spn-120502","marks":["italic"],"text":"runtime"},{"id":"spn-120503","text":" ledger (\"what was spent\"); Weave is the "},{"id":"spn-120504","marks":["italic"],"text":"static"},{"id":"spn-120505","text":" certificate (\"what can be spent, in what class, with termination guaranteed\"). Wired into "},{"id":"spn-120506","marks":["code"],"text":"govern()"},{"id":"spn-120507","text":", a computation that can't be certified to halt within budget becomes "},{"id":"spn-120508","marks":["code"],"text":"0̄"},{"id":"spn-120509","text":" — annihilated, not down-ranked — the same floor pattern the kernel already uses for forbidden actions. Three of your theses converge here: "},{"id":"spn-120510","marks":["bold"],"text":"symbol-as-system"},{"id":"spn-120511","text":" (the verdict is the arithmetic), "},{"id":"spn-120512","marks":["bold"],"text":"topology-as-warrant"},{"id":"spn-120513","text":" (κ licenses the shape of the reasoning), and "},{"id":"spn-120514","marks":["bold"],"text":"cost-as-certificate"},{"id":"spn-120515","text":" (the discipline that makes the fast path sound is the one that bounds cost). See "},{"id":"spn-120516","marks":["code"],"text":"weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md"},{"id":"spn-120517","text":" for the full integration and gap analysis."}]},{"id":"blk-86903","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120518","marks":["bold"],"text":"Update — the next step is taken (partway)."},{"id":"spn-120519","text":" "},{"id":"spn-120520","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120521","text":" now computes a real EAL box-decoration: a static box-nesting "},{"id":"spn-120522","marks":["italic"],"text":"depth"},{"id":"spn-120523","text":" (= certified elementary tower height) with a per-binder certificate, validated against "},{"id":"spn-120524","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-120525","text":" cost in "},{"id":"spn-120526","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-eal-test.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120527","text":" (certified-cheap never detonated; every "},{"id":"spn-120528","marks":["code"],"text":"eal:true"},{"id":"spn-120529","text":" term reduced oracle-free). The depth-1 rung's polynomial "},{"id":"spn-120530","marks":["italic"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-120531","text":" is recovered empirically in "},{"id":"spn-120532","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal-degree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120533","text":". And "},{"id":"spn-120534","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-hvm4-run.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120535","text":" wires the real HVM4 backend (6/6 differential agreement), confirming the certificate is substrate-independent."}]},{"id":"blk-86904","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120536","text":"What remains genuinely open: the polynomial "},{"id":"spn-120537","marks":["bold"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-120538","text":" is still "},{"id":"spn-120539","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-120540","text":", not statically inferred. Pinning it by type is "},{"id":"spn-120541","marks":["bold"],"text":"static LAL"},{"id":"spn-120542","text":" inference (Light Affine Logic / Baillot–Terui §-boxes) — the named boundary. EAL gives the certified "},{"id":"spn-120543","marks":["italic"],"text":"tower height"},{"id":"spn-120544","text":"; LAL would give the certified "},{"id":"spn-120545","marks":["italic"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-120546","text":"."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierabjh4hsukkzt2t5qbxut3hbtzmukcehhb4hiuerzlardrardzcuxa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}